Merge food innovation with technology to create accessible, efficient dining solutions. 
My vision is to launch ‘Cloud Meal Prep,’ a system where customers can pre-buy meals in bulk from cloud kitchens and trade their orders on a blockchain-powered secondary market. 
Starting in Minneapolis, I plan to prototype this idea and explore partnerships with companies like Lifetime Fitness. 
Together, we can revolutionize meal prep and food delivery, reshaping how people experience food through the power of Web3 and Cloud Kitchen technology.

